-- The teachers' general agreements' root (MMS-518): the agreements of the
-- corpus's agreements/teachers-general family that speak to an item of the
-- shared vocabulary (l4/lib/vocabulary.l4), each registered once as an
-- instrument (it describes itself in its own file), and what each claims
-- for a case. The agreements' root (l4/lib/agreements-root.l4) imports it
-- beside the other families' roots, and rules among all their agreements
-- by one rule (MMS-686); precedence between collections is left to
-- l4/lib/precedence.l4.
--
-- The agreement of 21.2.2008 gives the 2008 supplement; the agreement of
-- 17.6.2009 puts its third step off ("במקום משכורת חודש דצמבר 2009 יבוא
-- משכורת חודש אוקטובר 2011"), and the agreement of 24.11.2010 brings it
-- forward again ("כפי שתוקן בהסכם הקיבוצי מיום 17.6.09, במקום משכורת חודש
-- אוקטובר 2011 יבוא משכורת חודש נובמבר 2010"). All three are between the
-- State and הסתדרות המורים, on the same matter, so the later replaces the
-- earlier and §23 does not weigh them against each other (§19; convention
-- instruments.amendment-chain, put to the lawyer). What this file keeps of
-- it is when each amendment starts to speak.
--
-- A teacher paid by the Ofek Hadash tables is in none of their claims: the
-- base agreement's §44(ב)(1) took the 2001 and 2008 supplements into the
-- salary it converts, and §47 converts it again at the 21.2.2008
-- agreement's dates (convention instruments.converted-supplements).

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT precedence
IMPORT `2001-12-18_histadrut-hamorim_wage-agreement-1999-2001`
IMPORT `2008-02-21_teachers_tosefet-2008_wage-supplement`
IMPORT `2009-06-17_teachers_wage-update-deferral`
IMPORT `2010-11-24_teachers_wage-update-advancement`

§ `שורש ההסכמים הכלליים לעובדי הוראה — מה ההסכמים אומרים על כל פריט`

§§ `המסמכים`

-- This root includes the teachers' general agreements:
`the teachers' general agreements' instruments` MEANS
    LIST `the agreement of 18.12.2001`, `the agreement of 21.2.2008`, `the agreement of 17.6.2009`,
         `the agreement of 24.11.2010`

§§ `שרשרת התיקונים`

-- An amending agreement speaks of the salary months from the one it was
-- signed in: neither amendment sets itself another start that the corpus
-- dates (convention instruments.amendment-chain; the deferral's §4 waits on
-- the havraa statute, a day outside the corpus, and before December 2009
-- it changes no month of the agreement it amends).
GIVEN i IS AN `instrument`, c IS A `teaching case`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the amendment is in force in the salary month of` i c IF
    `the salary month is at least` c (DATE_YEAR (i's `issued`)) (DATE_MONTH (i's `issued`))

§§ `מה ההסכמים אומרים, לפי פריט`

-- An amendment says nothing of a salary month before the one it was signed
-- in; the agreement it amends speaks of that month alone.
GIVEN i IS AN `instrument`, a IS A MAYBE NUMBER, c IS A `teaching case`
GIVETH A MAYBE `claim`
DECIDE `the claim of the amendment` i a c IS
    IF `the amendment is in force in the salary month of` i c THEN `the claim of` i a ELSE NOTHING

GIVEN i IS A `pay item`, c IS A `teaching case`
GIVETH A LIST OF `claim`
DECIDE `the teachers' general agreements' claims on` i c IS
    CONSIDER i
    WHEN `the 2008 public-sector supplement` THEN
        catMaybes (LIST `the claim of` `the agreement of 21.2.2008` (`the 2008 supplement according to the agreement of 21.2.2008` c),
                        `the claim of the amendment` `the agreement of 17.6.2009`
                            (`the 2008 supplement according to the agreement of 21.2.2008 as amended on 17.6.2009` c) c,
                        `the claim of the amendment` `the agreement of 24.11.2010`
                            (`the 2008 supplement according to the agreement of 21.2.2008 as amended on 24.11.2010` c) c)
    WHEN `the 3% supplement of 2001` THEN
        catMaybes (LIST `the claim of` `the agreement of 18.12.2001` (`the 3% supplement according to the agreement of 18.12.2001` c))
    OTHERWISE EMPTY
